      {
        "id": 18612,
        "name": "Marsala",
        "username": "Marsala",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/6f9a4e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-08T00:35:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Because Constant Raiding causes damage after the power if finished. If a town/explorer comes back, does it die due to Military Response if there were dahan moved due to the power?</p>\n<p>E.g. Vigor moves two dahan into a land, then does two damage each, killing a city. The town returns into the land, does that:</p>\n<p>a. Die to the Constant Raiding</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - or -</p>\n<p>b. Get returned after the movement is finished, avoiding the damage completely?</p>\n<p>I am leaning toward (b). Reason being that the movement is resolved part of the power. Thanks in advance.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:01.525Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 273,
        "reads": 3,
        "readers_count": 2,
        "score": 1360.6,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 18611,
        "topic_slug": "dahan-insurrection-damage-question",
        "display_username": "Marsala",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
