      {
        "id": 222844,
        "name": "Eric R",
        "username": "Eric_R",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-08T15:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Reading strictly, the ordering is ambiguous - both \"add a Town\" and \"do 2 Damage\" are done after Vigor of the Breaking Dawn is resolved, so you get to decide which happens first.</p>\n<p>However, I believe it was tested with (b), so if you're looking for the published difficulty, go with that.</p>\n<p>(The wording is also all wrong for some standardization that I'm in the middle of trying to do - distinguishing between \"when X then Y\", which is immediate, and \"after X then Y\", which happens after a Power's finished resolving. Not crossing that bridge yet, though.)</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:51.877Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 3,
